>PIB2_mpnn15 synthetic construct de novo protein binder targeting the ATG8-family Interacting Motif (AIM, residues 372-381; anchors W378 and V381) of the Phytophthora infestans RXLR effector PexRD54; designed via BindCraft (AlphaFold2-multimer hallucination) and ProteinMPNN sequence design; CDS includes N-terminal initiator Met not present in the computationally validated 106-aa binder domain; complete cds

